{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10375","headline":"同羣公题郑少府田家 · 高适","name":"同羣公题郑少府田家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郑侯应凄惶，五十头尽白。\n昔爲南昌尉，今作东郡客。\n与语多远情，论心知所益。\n秋林既清旷，穷巷空淅沥。\n蝶舞园更闲，鸡鸣日云夕。\n男儿未称意，其道固无适。\n劝君且杜门，勿叹人事隔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}